#: app/templates/export.html:7
msgid "Your cards belong to you. You can download them <strong>with your learning progress</strong> at any time and continue in Anki (computer, AnkiDroid, AnkiMobile)."
msgstr "Deine Karten gehören dir. Du kannst sie jederzeit <strong>mit Lernstand</strong> herunterladen und in Anki (Computer, AnkiDroid, AnkiMobile) weiterlernen."

#: app/templates/export.html:11
msgid "Export everything"
msgstr "Alles exportieren"

#: app/templates/export.html:11
msgid "(for new Anki users)"
msgstr "(für neue Anki-Nutzer)"

#: app/templates/export.html:12
msgid "Replaces the collection in Anki when imported – only for empty/new Anki installations."
msgstr "Ersetzt beim Import die Sammlung in Anki – nur für leere/neue Anki-Installationen."

#: app/templates/export.html:15
msgid "Download everything (.colpkg)"
msgstr "Alles herunterladen (.colpkg)"

#: app/templates/export.html:20
msgid "Export deck"
msgstr "Deck exportieren"

#: app/templates/export.html:20
msgid "(add to an existing Anki)"
msgstr "(in bestehendes Anki einfügen)"

#: app/templates/export.html:21
msgid "One deck with learning progress and deck options. Existing cards in Anki are kept."
msgstr "Ein Deck mit Lernstand und Deck-Optionen. Bestehende Karten in Anki bleiben erhalten."

#: app/templates/export.html:28
msgid "Download deck (.apkg)"
msgstr "Deck herunterladen (.apkg)"

#: app/templates/export.html:33
msgid "How to continue in Anki"
msgstr "So geht's weiter in Anki"

#: app/templates/export.html:36
msgid "Install Anki"
msgstr "Anki installieren"

#: app/templates/export.html:37
msgid "Computer: <a href=\"https://apps.ankiweb.net\">apps.ankiweb.net</a> (free) · Android: “AnkiDroid” in the Play Store (free) · iPhone: “AnkiMobile” in the App Store."
msgstr "Computer: <a href=\"https://apps.ankiweb.net\">apps.ankiweb.net</a> (kostenlos) · Android: „AnkiDroid“ im Play Store (kostenlos) · iPhone: „AnkiMobile“ im App Store."

#: app/templates/export.html:39
msgid "Open the file"
msgstr "Datei öffnen"

#: app/templates/export.html:40
msgid "Computer: double-click the file or use <em>File → Import</em> in Anki. AnkiDroid: menu <em>⋮ → Import</em> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr "Computer: Datei doppelklicken oder in Anki <em>Datei → Importieren</em>. AnkiDroid: Menü <em>⋮ → Importieren</em> und die heruntergeladene Datei wählen."

#: app/templates/export.html:42
msgid "Create an AnkiWeb account"
msgstr "AnkiWeb-Konto anlegen"

#: app/templates/export.html:43
msgid "Free at <a href=\"https://ankiweb.net\">ankiweb.net</a> – keeps your phone and computer in sync."
msgstr "Kostenlos auf <a href=\"https://ankiweb.net\">ankiweb.net</a> – damit bleiben Handy und Computer gleich."

#: app/templates/export.html:45
msgid "Sync"
msgstr "Synchronisieren"

#: app/templates/export.html:46
msgid "Tap <em>Sync</em> in Anki and log in with your AnkiWeb account. Done!"
msgstr "In Anki auf <em>Synchronisieren</em> tippen und mit dem AnkiWeb-Konto anmelden. Fertig!"

